  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blue Action Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This agreement will support the Blue Action Fund&apos;s grant programme to support marine conservation projects implemented by NGOs in their efforts to conserve the ocean and improve the livelihoods of coastal communities in developing countries. The intended impact is that networks of globally significant marine protected areas and their sustainable use zones are conserved. Protecting marine resources will contribute to reduced carbon emissions. The programme has developed a Gender Responsive guide and gender equity is an evaluation criteria for applications.</narrative>
  </description>
